# detail
Number of changes: 1

1. Modified | Implementation code block
   Replaced a single-line Boolean-expression return with an `if/elif/else` conditional-return structure.
   The original implementation included:
   * Return statement: return `isinstance(dtype, ExtensionDtype) or registry.find(dtype) is not None`.

   The new implementation includes:
   * Conditional statement: return `True` when `dtype` is an `ExtensionDtype`;
   * Conditional statement: return `False` when `dtype` is an `np.dtype`;
   * Return statement: otherwise, return `registry.find(dtype) is not None`.
# /detail
# mode：Modify control-flow structure (replace direct return with multi-branch conditional returns)
